{
 "type": "doc",
 "version": 1,
 "content": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "1. What happens now"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The Inventory Value report remembers the category and vendor a user picked. If one of those saved choices later stops existing in the data, the report keeps using it anyway. The result is a report that opens showing nothing, with no explanation, and no obvious way for the user to work out why - the filter that is emptying the report is one they cannot see any more."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "2. What should happen instead"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Inventory Value requirement S8-R6: \"Restore is defensive: a saved value that is no longer valid falls back to that setting's default rather than breaking the view. A saved category or vendor no longer present in the data is dropped.\""
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "So the stale choice should be quietly discarded on load and the report should open on its normal full list."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "3. How to see it"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "orderedList",
   "attrs": {
    "order": 1
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Sign in and open "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Reports",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " > "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Inventory Value",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Choose a category in the "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Category",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " filter, so the choice is saved."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Make that saved choice no longer valid - the quickest reliable way is to change the stored category to one that does not exist in the data."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Reload the report."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Exact test data this was seen with:",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " the saved category was replaced with the identifier "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "code"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", which matches no category in this organisation. Locations "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Heavy Duty - 9919",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " and "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Staging Lethbridge - 4310",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", date range "
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "This Month",
     "marks": [
      {
       "type": "strong"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": ", 5,657 rows in scope before the change."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "4. What was actually seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The report loaded without an error message, but:"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "the stale category was "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "not",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " dropped - it was still there in the saved settings afterwards, unchanged;"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "it was still being applied, so the table came back with "
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "no data rows at all",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": ", down from 5,657."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "The user is left looking at an empty report caused by a filter selection that no longer corresponds to anything."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "5. What was ruled out"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "bulletList",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not a crash.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The page renders and no error is shown - which is part of the problem, because nothing tells the user what happened."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not the rest of the restoring.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The date range, locations, columns and sort were all restored correctly in the same load, so the restore path itself is running."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "listItem",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "paragraph",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "It is not a stale-cache effect.",
         "marks": [
          {
           "type": "strong"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": " The saved settings were re-read after the load and the invalid identifier was still present."
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "6. How often"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Every time."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "attrs": {
    "level": 3
   },
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "7. Where it was seen"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Reports > Inventory Value, on the QA branch, build v3.5-16cf83f, on 6 August 2026."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": " "
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "Where this expected behaviour comes from: the Inventory Value report specification, version 4, requirement S8-R6, which says: \"Restore is defensive: a saved value that is no longer valid falls back to that setting's default rather than breaking the view. A saved category or vendor no longer present in the data is dropped.\""
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}